      "value": "I've had this so much lately. \n\nA friend changes their avatar and there is a chance that I crash when it's downloaded and starts/finishes loading.\n\nA person joins the lobby and there is a chance I crash as the avatar loads in.\n\nSomeone leaves and there is also a chance, tho it seems smaller. \n\nWhen we moved world through a portal due to our group being say 30+ people, I crashed after a chunk of them had gone into it. \n\nThis also in many cases crashes SteamVR as well.",
